WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.442
- [Conan] We have a very special guest

00:00:01.442 --> 00:00:02.952
in the audience tonight.

00:00:02.952 --> 00:00:05.960
You gotta give it up, Reed
Richards, of the Fantastic Four,

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:07.378
is sitting in the crowd.

00:00:07.378 --> 00:00:09.797
(applause)

00:00:09.797 --> 00:00:11.880
- Happy to be here Conan.

00:00:12.987 --> 00:00:14.393
Thank you, thanks.

00:00:14.393 --> 00:00:15.622
I'm a big fan.

00:00:15.622 --> 00:00:17.969
- Okay, I'm glad you're a fan,
Dr. Richards, that's great.

00:00:17.969 --> 00:00:20.625
I would ask you please if
you could not sit like that.

00:00:20.625 --> 00:00:22.620
All right, it's not really cool.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.016
(laughing)

00:00:24.016 --> 00:00:25.876
- Is there a problem, Conan?

00:00:25.876 --> 00:00:27.880
(applause)

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:28.883
- Yeah.

00:00:28.883 --> 00:00:31.133
(applause)

00:00:32.635 --> 00:00:34.499
There's a problem, yeah.

00:00:34.499 --> 00:00:36.194
The theater has certain rules.

00:00:36.194 --> 00:00:38.578
Anyone sitting in the
balcony must have their feet

00:00:38.578 --> 00:00:40.608
on the floor at all times.

00:00:40.608 --> 00:00:42.515
It's for your own safety,
and it wouldn't be fair

00:00:42.515 --> 00:00:44.314
to everyone else, you know.

00:00:44.314 --> 00:00:45.147
- Well, guess what?

00:00:45.147 --> 00:00:46.610
I'm complying with the rules.

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:48.096
My feet are on the floor.

00:00:48.096 --> 00:00:48.929
(laughing)

00:00:48.929 --> 00:00:50.969
- Okay, no, that's not
what they meant, no.

00:00:50.969 --> 00:00:51.912
(laughing)

00:00:51.912 --> 00:00:52.745
- Duh, a little help down there.

00:00:52.745 --> 00:00:53.987
Can someone scratch my ankle?

00:00:53.987 --> 00:00:55.498
- No, no, just leave him, okay.

00:00:55.498 --> 00:00:59.620
And of course, no one
helping him. (laughing)

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:01.144
You know you're takin' up a lot of room,

00:01:01.144 --> 00:01:03.557
frankly, it's rude, okay.

00:01:03.557 --> 00:01:05.898
- I don't hear anyone in
the theater complaining.

00:01:05.898 --> 00:01:07.031
Right, we're just havin' fun,

00:01:07.031 --> 00:01:08.172
just havin' fun.

00:01:08.172 --> 00:01:10.422
(applause)

00:01:13.502 --> 00:01:14.919
- Please. Please!

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:19.204
Please, just pull your
arms and legs in, okay?

00:01:19.204 --> 00:01:21.989
Please, all right, let's move on.

00:01:21.989 --> 00:01:23.154
We have an amazing show tonight.

00:01:23.154 --> 00:01:27.321
(laughing)
(applause)

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:39.333
That is not cool, Reed Richards.

00:01:39.333 --> 00:01:42.604
- Whoa, why do you assume it's me?

00:01:42.604 --> 00:01:43.763
- All right.

00:01:43.763 --> 00:01:44.596
(laughing)

00:01:44.596 --> 00:01:45.668
Oh, seriously?

00:01:45.668 --> 00:01:47.796
(applause)

00:01:47.796 --> 00:01:50.203
- Okay, that seriously, that one's me.

00:01:50.203 --> 00:01:51.036
That's me.

00:01:51.036 --> 00:01:52.805
- Reed Richards, everybody.

00:01:52.805 --> 00:01:55.055
(applause)

